---
title: "reserve::borrow_amount (Current Finance: Lending Protocol)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_liquidity: cash - cash_reserve.ceil() > amount?
    q_check_liquidity --> q_error_liquidity: insufficient liquidity
    q_check_liquidity --> q_update_debt: sufficient liquidity
    q_error_liquidity --> [*]: abort reserve_not_enough_error
    q_update_debt --> q_withdraw: debt = debt + amount
    q_withdraw --> [*]: withdraw_underlying(amount), return Balance

    note right of q_check_liquidity
        INV-001: available_liquidity = cash - cash_reserve.ceil()
        INV-002: debt increases by borrow amount
        INV-003: cash decreases by borrow amount
        INV-004: cash >= cash_reserve after borrow
    end note
